  "description": "Lightweight and full-featured data Grid control with NET4 and NET6+ support. The Grid Control for NET offers a very fast data grid for your Visual Studio projects. Includes NET Core support and improved javascript visualisation via jsGrid.\nDemo code: https://github.com/Steema/TeeGrid-NET-Samples",
